> f(x: u8) = (x*3) xor 9
> g(x: u8) = ((x*3) xor 9) + (x == 1 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 10 vs 11
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=1: 11 vs 10
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  0..255   (256 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range g
range of g -> u8:
  0..255   (255 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 256 points of the domain
